    "summary": "Two accepted text changes since v4.3 are now reflected in the reading editions. (1) v4.5 renamed 24 mission titles to fit the mission-select bar, so every episode heading that printed a shortened title now prints the new one (60 heading lines across 17 episodes, both `## Ep. N …` and `## Wariant tekstu DLC — Ep. N …`). (2) The v4.4 story-language review corrected 22 dialogue rows; where those rows belong to a DLC variant shown in an episode, the corrected variant now matches the accepted rendering of the base scene, so it is verified as an alias instead of being printed as a separate fragment (episodes 03 and 08 lose 15 redundant fragment lines; no text is lost - every removed line is present verbatim elsewhere in the same episode). Episode 34 contains none of the changed rows and is carried over byte-identically. Totals cover the 34 rebuilt episodes: 39,585/39,585 prose entries (100%), 29,891 unique + 9,694 aliases, 30,315 verified spans, 2,436,877 B of Markdown; adding the carried episode 34 (7,471/7,471 verified in v4.3) keeps the series at 47,056/47,056."
